  ok  a wholesale rewrite asks nothing (neither close in spelling nor in sound)
  ok  matchHeard claims a recent, similar dictation
  ok  matchHeard REFUSES a typed message — this is how a typed sentence stays silent
  ok  matchHeard REFUSES a dictation older than the window, and one already reconciled
  ok  matchHeard breaks a tie toward the more recent dictation — he is looking at the last one
  ok  reviewSent on a TYPED message returns no prompts and says why
  ok  reviewSent on an UNCHANGED dictation returns no prompts — nothing was corrected
  ok  reviewSent asks the exact sentence §7 specifies
  ok  the diff is taken against what was PASTED, not the recognizer's raw output
  ok  NO route out of reviewSent carries a learn — the review cannot change what the system believes
  ok  a DECLINE is not permanent: the very next repeat asks again, and says it has asked before
